The full skywire command module for GOOS=js (skywire.wasm.gz) is placed here
by the two-stage build (make build-embedded, publish-binary.yml, release.yml)
and embedded into the native binary. It is gitignored: a plain `go build .`
embeds only this file and the visor falls back to the disk path. See
pkg/wasmhv/execwasm.
